SPDX-FileNotice: retrods local patch, not part of upstream Genesis-Plus-GX.

Shrink the Sega CD cartridge area.

cd_cart_t::area is 0x810000 (8 MB + 64 KB) and sits inside the external_t
union, so every build pays for it: `ext` came out at ~10 MB, more than a DSi can
spare alongside the rest of the core. Only Sega CD cartridge ROMs use it, Mega
Drive cartridges use md_cart_t::rom, and this build has CD support disabled
(CHD/libchdr dropped), so 64 KB is plenty.

Applied with: patch -p1 < patches/Genesis-Plus-GX/0001-shrink-cd-cart-area.patch
